---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Rooted Tides"
  description="Meet Sarah and learn about the traditional Usui Shiki Ryoho lineage behind Rooted Tides."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <div class="container section">
    <h1>About Sarah</h1>
    <p class="small">
      Rooted Tides is a quiet space to come back to yourself—steady, gentle, and grounded.
      Sarah’s approach is nature-connected and deeply respectful of each person’s experience.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:22px;">
      <div class="card" style="padding:22px;">
        <h2>Lineage</h2>
        <p class="small">
          Sarah practices within the traditional <strong>Usui Shiki Ryoho</strong> healing system,
          which comes from the lineage of <strong>Reiki Master Mikao Usui</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">What sessions feel like</h2>
        <p class="small">
          Calm, quiet, and supportive. Many clients describe Reiki as a deep exhale—an invitation
          for the body to soften and for the mind to settle.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">Values</h2>
        <ul class="small" style="margin:0; padding-left:18px;">
          <li>Consent and comfort first</li>
          <li>Grounded, non-performative care</li>
          <li>Space for rest, release, and reconnection</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="/images/sarah-garden.jpg" alt="Sarah outdoors under green leaves." style="width:100%; height:520px; object-fit:cover; display:block;" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
